# caught-looking

- **Stack**: Go 1.22 API (`backend/`, chi), React 19 + Vite + TypeScript (`frontend/`).
- **Local dev**: from repo root, `make dev` runs the API (:8080) and Vite; the frontend proxies `/api` to the backend (see `Makefile`).
- **Conventions**: follow the scoped rules when editing `frontend/**/*.tsx`, `frontend/src/api/**/*.ts`, `frontend/src/types/api.generated.ts`, `frontend/src/types/api.compat.ts`, `backend/apidocs/openapi.yaml`, `frontend/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}`, `backend/**/*.go`, or **`README.md`**. OpenAPI workflow: **`.cursor/skills/openapi-maintain/SKILL.md`**. Frontend tests: **`.cursor/skills/frontend-vitest-tests/SKILL.md`**. Frontend Prettier: **`.cursor/rules/frontend-prettier.mdc`** (agents must run Prettier on changed files). Editor format-on-save: **`.vscode/settings.json`** (install recommended Prettier extension). README: **`.cursor/rules/readme.mdc`**.
- **Before opening a PR**: CI must pass (`frontend`: OpenAPI lint + generated-type drift check, lint, Prettier check, typecheck, test, build; `backend`: vet, test, build). For API edits, run **`make check-openapi`** from repo root. Fill out `.github/pull_request_template.md`.
